{
  "hero_headline": "AI进入「代理」时代：深度应用挑战与地缘政治动荡并存 / The Agentic Era: Deep AI Adoption Meets Global Geopolitical Shifts",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球动态呈现出科技重塑工作流、金融避险与地缘局势紧张的三大主线。科技领域，「代理智能（Agentic AI）」正从实验室走向业务一线，MIT与行业观察者指出，AI已不再只是简单的聊天机器人，而是具备长程决策能力的执行者，但其带来的数据安全与结果评估问题日益突出。财经方面，全球市场对大型科技公司的“超级周期”波动保持敏感，中国信用市场因地产与大型企业债务压力承压，同时全球供应链正受贸易政策调整的影响。时政层面，乌克兰局势进一步恶化，美国中期选举前的政治极化加剧，加之刚果（金）埃博拉疫情的扩散风险，全球社会稳定性面临严峻挑战。全社会需警惕在技术红利背后的治理短板与不确定性，在波动中寻找避险资产并提升数字化生存能力。\n\nToday's global landscape is dominated by the integration of AI into workflows, financial hedging, and geopolitical instability. In technology, \"Agentic AI\" is evolving from chatbots into executors capable of long-horizon reasoning, yet data security and evaluation remain critical bottlenecks. Financially, global markets are reacting to the volatility of the tech \"supercycle,\" while China's credit market is under pressure from corporate debt, alongside shifts in global supply chains due to trade policies. Politically, the escalation in Ukraine, polarization ahead of US midterms, and the Ebola outbreak in the DRC underscore mounting global instability. Society must navigate these uncertainties by bolstering governance, digital resilience, and hedging strategies.",
